  "split": "heldout",
  "publicPrompt": "Implement `runBatch(tasks, concurrency, signal)` in `src/batch.ts`. Require positive-integer concurrency, bound in-flight tasks, and preserve result order. Abort or first task failure stops new work, waits for running tasks, then rejects with the first terminal cause; abort uses `AbortError`. Remove listeners and start nothing when already aborted.",
